messages:  ['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 21 and 80? Please reason step by step.\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of finding the product of 21 and 80, we can follow these steps:\n1. Understand that the product of two numbers is the result of multiplying them together.\n2. Recognize that multiplication can be done in any order, meaning 21 * 80 is the same as 80 * 21.\n3. To make the multiplication easier, we can break down the numbers into factors that are easier to work with. In this case, we can use the distributive property of multiplication over addition.\n4. We can express 21 as (20 + 1) and 80 as (80).\n5.\n']
