      "index": 0,
      "text": "Now, we need to multiply 58 by 60 (the tens digit of 65, which is 6 with a zero added at the end):\n```\n  58\n\u00d7 60\n-----\n 3480\n```\n<\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>Next, we add the two results together:\n```\n  290\n+3480\n-----\n 3770\n```\nTherefore, the product of 58 and 65 is 3770.\n</answer>",
