messages:  ["Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 62 and 72? Please reason step by step.\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of finding the product of 62 and 72, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. This involves multiplying each digit of one number by each digit of the other number and then adding the results. Let's break it down step by step.\n</think>\n<answer>\nFirst, let's write the numbers one below the other for clarity:\n```\n  62\n× 72\n```\nWe can break this into two parts: multiplying 62 by 70, and then multiplying 62 by 2. This is because 72 can be expressed as 70 + 2.\n1. Multiplying 62 by 70:\n   - We can think of this as 62 × 7 × 10. First, multiply 62 by 7:\n     ```\n     62\n   ×  7\n   -----\n     434\n     ```\n   - Then, multiply the result by 10 (which is the same as adding a zero at the end):\n     ```\n     434\n   ×  10\n   -----\n     4340\n     ```\n2. Multiplying 62 by 2:\n   - This is straightforward:\n     ```\n     62\n   ×  2\n   -----\n     124\n     ```\n"]
